# game/case05.rpy:82
translate japanese press_eiki_1_e3763dea:

    # you "Who says it vanished at three?"
    you "三時に消えたと誰が言っている？"

# game/case05.rpy:83
translate japanese press_eiki_1_b7c31367:

    # eiki "Sakuya's roster, and Sakuya's pocket watch. The time is not in dispute."
    eiki "咲夜の名簿と、咲夜の懐中時計です。時刻に争いはありません。"

# game/case05.rpy:87
translate japanese press_eiki_2_8b96bace:

    # you "If Meiling didn't take it, who did?"
    you "美鈴が取っていないなら、誰が取った？"

# game/case05.rpy:89
translate japanese press_eiki_2_69a37da6:

    # eiki "Undetermined. Not every case needs a culprit. Some only need a verdict."
    eiki "未確定です。すべての事件に犯人が必要なわけではありません。判決だけが必要な事件もあります。"

# game/case05.rpy:91
translate japanese press_eiki_2_8f39dcbd:

    # komachi "That's... not a great sentence, boss."
    komachi "それは……あんまりいい台詞じゃないですよ、四季様。"

# game/case05.rpy:95
translate japanese press_eiki_3_adb42788:

    # you "Why can't the appeal succeed?"
    you "なぜ上訴は認められない？"

# game/case05.rpy:97
translate japanese press_eiki_3_d55cc248:

    # eiki "Because my verdicts are correct. Obviously."
    eiki "私の判決が正しいからです。当然でしょう。"

# game/case05.rpy:98
translate japanese press_eiki_3_175db7f6:

    # eiki "Enter that into my testimony, Junior Judge. In full."
    eiki "それを私の証言に記録しなさい、見習い判事。一言一句。"

# game/case05.rpy:102
translate japanese press_eiki_4_1369d0e5:

    # you "How do you know your verdicts are correct?"
    you "自分の判決が正しいと、どうして分かる？"

# game/case05.rpy:103
translate japanese press_eiki_4_b02a74ba:

    # eiki "Because I gave them. Were you not listening?"
    eiki "私が下したからです。聞いていなかったのですか？"

# game/case05.rpy:105
translate japanese press_eiki_4_e788fa5f:

    # komachi "Boss, that's the reason and the answer. It's the same thing twice."
    komachi "四季様、それ理由と答えが同じですよ。同じことを二回言ってるだけです。"

# game/case05.rpy:116
translate japanese case5_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "静粛に。彼岸論理法廷を開廷します。"

# game/case05.rpy:118
translate japanese case5_b506956e:

    # eiki "Komachi. The defendant?"
    eiki "小町。被告人は？"

# game/case05.rpy:119
translate japanese case5_847bf41e:

    # komachi "About that, boss. There isn't one. It's an appeal."
    komachi "そのことなんですけどね、四季様。被告はいません。上訴なんです。"

# game/case05.rpy:120
translate japanese case5_c03b32ca:

    # eiki "An appeal of what?"
    eiki "何の上訴です？"

# game/case05.rpy:121
translate japanese case5_2641c76c:

    # komachi "The vanished pudding. The mansion says the thief was never found."
    komachi "消えたプリンの件です。館が言うには、犯人は見つかってないって。"

# game/case05.rpy:122
translate japanese case5_46dcb941:

    # komachi "And a cup turned up at Misty Lake. Frozen solid."
    komachi "それと、霧の湖でカップが見つかりました。カチカチに凍って。"

# game/case05.rpy:123
translate japanese case5_2ba3b55e:

    # eiki "That case is closed. I closed it."
    eiki "あの事件は閉廷しました。私が閉じたのです。"

# game/case05.rpy:124
translate japanese case5_e7448c0e:

    # komachi "The appeal names your verdict, boss. A judge can't hear her own appeal."
    komachi "上訴は四季様の判決を相手取ってるんです。裁判官は自分の上訴を審理できませんよ。"

# game/case05.rpy:126
translate japanese case5_47a1d365:

    # eiki "..."
    eiki "……"

# game/case05.rpy:127
translate japanese case5_19d3aa65:

    # eiki "...Rules are rules. Even mine. Especially mine."
    eiki "……規則は規則です。私の規則でも。私の規則なら、なおさら。"

# game/case05.rpy:128
translate japanese case5_fd6e30cc:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. Take the bench. I will take the stand."
    eiki "見習い判事。裁判長席に着きなさい。私は証言台に立ちます。"

# game/case05.rpy:131
translate japanese case5_5411b165:

    # eiki "Shiki Eiki, Yama of Paradise. I will explain why this appeal wastes everyone's afternoon."
    eiki "四季映姫・ヤマザナドゥ。この上訴がいかに皆の午後を無駄にするか、説明しましょう。"

# game/case05.rpy:134
translate japanese case5_a907644c:

    # komachi "The bench is yours, Junior Judge. The gavel's heavier than it looks."
    komachi "裁判長席はあなたのものですよ、見習い判事。木槌は見た目より重いですから。"

# game/case05.rpy:135
translate japanese case5_7dd9328e:

    # komachi "The boss always says it: listen for where the reasons run in circles."
    komachi "四季様がいつも言ってます。理由が堂々巡りしているところに耳を澄ませろって。"

# game/case05.rpy:149
translate japanese case5_ab2c0e3d:

    # eiki_t "The pudding vanished from the mansion kitchen at three o'clock."
    eiki_t "プリンは三時に館の厨房から消えました。"

# game/case05.rpy:150
translate japanese case5_16506389:

    # eiki_t "Hong Meiling was found not guilty. I reviewed every page of that trial."
    eiki_t "紅美鈴は無罪となりました。私はその審理の全ページを見直しました。"

# game/case05.rpy:151
translate japanese case5_2f71f08d:

    # eiki_t "This appeal cannot succeed. My verdict stands."
    eiki_t "この上訴は認められません。私の判決は覆りません。"

# game/case05.rpy:155
translate japanese case5_1c0b7ef4:

    # komachi "Your witness. [spirit_Word!t] magatama of spirit, same as always. She'd want it fair."
    komachi "証人をどうぞ。霊力の勾玉はいつも通り[spirit_Word!t]つ。四季様も公平にって言うでしょうし。"

# game/case05.rpy:169
translate japanese case5_cross_1fa9e366:

    # komachi "Deep breath, Junior Judge. Even the boss gets a second hearing."
    komachi "深呼吸ですよ、見習い判事。四季様だって二度目の審理を受けるんですから。"

# game/case05.rpy:180
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_d381048b:

    # you "This cup came from the mansion and froze at Misty Lake. Your verdict says nothing about it."
    you "このカップは館のもので、霧の湖で凍っていた。あなたの判決はこれについて何も語っていない。"

# game/case05.rpy:181
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_560d3c82:

    # you "Your reason was your conclusion. Evidence breaks the circle. Your argument never left it."
    you "あなたの理由はあなたの結論だった。証拠は輪を断ち切る。あなたの論証は輪から一歩も出ていない。"

# game/case05.rpy:184
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_67403bfc:

    # eiki "My scales... They tipped. They have never tipped."
    eiki "私の天秤が……傾いた。一度も傾いたことがないのに。"

# game/case05.rpy:187
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_07fd5c4e:

    # eiki "Circular reasoning. The conclusion hides inside the reason, so the argument only proves itself."
    eiki "循環論法。結論が理由の中に隠れているため、論証は自分自身しか証明しません。"

# game/case05.rpy:188
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_b19921c2:

    # eiki "\"I am right because I am never wrong.\" I have sentenced souls for less."
    eiki "「私は決して間違えないから正しい」。これより軽い罪で魂を裁いてきました。"

# game/case05.rpy:196
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_dda81141:

    # you "In the matter of the vanished pudding, this court finds the appeal..."
    you "消えたプリンの件につき、当法廷は上訴を……"

# game/case05.rpy:207
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_6a1b4911:

    # komachi "Case 03 is reopened. Which means we still need a thief."
    komachi "第三の事件は再審です。つまり、まだ犯人が必要ってことで。"

# game/case05.rpy:210
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_c6dacea2:

    # cirno "Hey! Who dug up my ice block? I was keeping that pudding cold!"
    cirno "おい！あたいの氷を掘り返したの誰だ！プリンを冷やしてたのに！"

# game/case05.rpy:212
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_29b6de30:

    # komachi "And there she is."
    komachi "ほら、来た。"

# game/case05.rpy:215
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_722f3f16:

    # cirno "It was going to melt in that kitchen! I saved it. That makes me a hero."
    cirno "あの厨房じゃ溶けちゃうところだったんだ！あたいが助けたんだぞ。つまりあたいは英雄だ。"

# game/case05.rpy:218
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_23854263:

    # eiki "Cirno. Saving it would mean giving it back. Not eating half."
    eiki "チルノ。助けるとは返すことです。半分食べることではありません。"

# game/case05.rpy:219
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_3adc75a5:

    # eiki "...Junior Judge. This one is yours to sentence."
    eiki "……見習い判事。この判決はあなたに任せます。"

# game/case05.rpy:222
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_a0e5e9c0:

    # you "Return what's left of the pudding. And write \"a verdict needs evidence\" fifty times."
    you "残ったプリンを返すこと。それと「判決には証拠が要る」と五十回書くこと。"

# game/case05.rpy:226
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_73c1a30f:

    # eiki "Make it a hundred. I will write mine beside hers."
    eiki "百回にしなさい。私も彼女の隣で書きます。"

# game/case05.rpy:227
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_40c1efee:

    # komachi "Court's adjourned, then. First time I've seen the boss on that side of the stand."
    komachi "じゃ、閉廷ってことで。四季様があっち側に立つの、初めて見ましたよ。"

# game/case05.rpy:228
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_b1bb5a20:

    # eiki "And the last, Komachi."
    eiki "そして最後です、小町。"

# game/case05.rpy:229
translate japanese case5_breakthrough_40be4001:

    # komachi "Whatever you say, boss."
    komachi "はいはい、四季様の仰せのままに。"

translate japanese strings:

    # game/case05.rpy:12
    old "Case 03 Verdict"
    new "第三の事件の判決"

    # game/case05.rpy:12
    old "Hong Meiling: NOT GUILTY. The real thief: \"Undetermined.\" Signed, Shiki Eiki."
    new "紅美鈴：無罪。真犯人：「未確定」。署名、四季映姫。"

    # game/case05.rpy:14
    old "Frozen Pudding Cup"
    new "凍ったプリンのカップ"

    # game/case05.rpy:14
    old "Found at Misty Lake inside a block of fairy ice. Bat crest on the cup. Half eaten."
    new "霧の湖で、妖精の氷の中から発見。カップにコウモリの紋章。半分食べてある。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "The Unappealable Verdict"
    new "覆らない判決"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "The pudding vanished from the mansion kitchen at three o'clock."
    new "プリンは三時に館の厨房から消えました。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "The time's on the roster, Junior Judge. That part's solid."
    new "時刻は名簿にありますよ、見習い判事。そこは確かです。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "Hong Meiling was found not guilty. I reviewed every page of that trial."
    new "紅美鈴は無罪となりました。私はその審理の全ページを見直しました。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "Meiling's acquittal checks out. You helped win it, remember?"
    new "美鈴の無罪は確かです。あなたも勝ち取るのを手伝ったでしょう？"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "This appeal cannot succeed. My verdict stands."
    new "この上訴は認められません。私の判決は覆りません。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "That's a claim, not a reason. Press her for the reason first."
    new "それは主張であって、理由ではありません。先に理由を揺さぶって聞き出しましょう。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "My verdicts are correct because I gave them. And I only give correct verdicts."
    new "私の判決は、私が下したから正しいのです。そして私は正しい判決しか下しません。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "Close. But she isn't leaning on someone else's name. She's leaning on her own conclusion."
    new "惜しい。でも四季様は他人の名前に寄りかかってるんじゃなくて、自分の結論に寄りかかってるんです。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "Nothing here happens before anything else. The reasoning goes around, not forward."
    new "ここでは何も何かの前に起きてません。理屈が前に進まず、ぐるぐる回ってるんです。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "She isn't attacking anyone. She's defending her verdict with her verdict."
    new "四季様は誰も攻撃してません。判決を判決で弁護してるんです。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "Nobody else is being blamed. Look at the reason, then look at the claim."
    new "誰も責められてませんよ。理由を見て、それから主張を見てください。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "No either-or here. Just one idea chasing its own tail."
    new "あれかこれか、じゃないです。一つの考えが自分のしっぽを追いかけてるだけ。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "No chain of disasters. Just a circle."
    new "災厄の連鎖はなし。ただの輪っかです。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "That still comes from her. Show something that doesn't depend on her word."
    new "それもまだ四季様から出たものです。四季様の言葉に頼らないものを見せてください。"

    # game/case05.rpy:200
    old "UPHELD"
    new "UPHELD"

